## Tech Stack

- Framework: Tauri v2 (Rust backend + React + TypeScript frontend)
- UI: React + Tailwind CSS
- AI: Claude API (claude-sonnet-4-6), streaming for NL queries
- File watching: notify crate (Rust) — FSEvents on macOS
- Memory: SQLite via tauri-plugin-sql
- State: Zustand (frontend), tauri-plugin-store (persistence)
- Notifications: tauri-plugin-notification

