## SQLite Schema (source of truth — do not vibe this)

```sql
rules (
  id, name, conditions_json, destination,
  created_at, last_applied_at, apply_count
)

move_history (
  id, rule_id, source_path, destination_path,
  moved_at, undone BOOLEAN
)

sessions (id, created_at, updated_at)
messages (id, session_id, role, content, created_at)
```

Example conditions_json:

```json
{
  "match": "any",
  "conditions": [
    { "field": "extension", "op": "in", "value": ["pdf", "docx"] },
    { "field": "filename", "op": "contains", "value": "invoice" }
  ]
}
```

