## Window Configuration

- decorations: false
- always_on_top: true
- skip_taskbar: true
- transparent: true
- focus: false — never steals focus from active app
- width: 340px
- height: dynamic, max 80vh
- position: right edge, vertically centered
- vibrancy: macOS Sidebar material via window-vibrancy crate

---

## Panel — 3 States

### State 1 — Dashboard (default on summon)

- Recent moves feed (last 10, each with undo if within 30s)
- Pending files inbox (unresolved, with destination chips)
- Soft summary: X files moved today, Y rules active

### State 2 — Rule Editor

- Full list of rules sorted by usage frequency
- Tap to edit conditions or destination
- Toggle enable/disable per rule
- Delete rule (with confirmation)

### State 3 — Conversation

- Chat-style freeform input
- Streaming Claude responses
- Can surface move history, trigger rule creation, or execute undo
- Destructive actions show confirm step before execution

